n platform. The tracks disappear under a moss and ivy covered medieval stone archway which is part of a town wall. The tracks and arch are surrounded by full green trees under a cloudy blue sky." referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://pxscdn.com/public/m/_v2/787879165920376064/f0975049d-79c41a/Qc4lnzzBDYPC/MyMaF8glHpcSgFoDOpai1MnBUF6OhABvxKOZSpQ0.jpg"/&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>